{"archetypes":{"chart":{"options":{"scales":{"x":{"stacked":true},"y":{"beginAtZero":true,"stacked":true}},"plugins":{"legend":{"position":"top","display":true}},"maintainAspectRatio":false},"dataOptions":{"cutOffCount":12,"dataProperty":"dato","getChartData":"const rows=Array.isArray(data?.dato)?data.dato:[];const ordered=[...rows].sort((a,b)=>String(a?.mese||'').localeCompare(String(b?.mese||'')));return {labels:ordered.map(r=>r?.mese||''),datasets:[{label:'Pipeline lordo',data:ordered.map(r=>Number(r?.pipeline_lordo||0)),backgroundColor:'#93c5fd'},{label:'Forecast pesato',data:ordered.map(r=>Number(r?.forecast_pesato||0)),backgroundColor:'#1d4ed8'}]};"},"type":"bar"}}}